208
00:14:31,330 --> 00:14:33,707
Well, I for one...

209
00:14:35,209 --> 00:14:36,752
I'm going to miss him.

210
00:14:41,465 --> 00:14:43,175
That dumb, horny bastard.

211
00:14:45,177 --> 00:14:46,762
You gentlemen
mind if I join you?

212
