Stan Williams. Genetics.

231
00:15:31,265 --> 00:15:32,516
Stan Williams.

232
00:15:32,850 --> 00:15:35,769
This is Aldo Ferrara, head
of Department of Diagnostics

233
00:15:35,978 --> 00:15:37,229
