234
00:15:37,438 --> 00:15:38,439
Glad to meet you.

235
00:15:38,856 --> 00:15:39,940
Thank you.

236
00:15:40,149 --> 00:15:41,149
Uh, listen.

237
00:15:41,609 --> 00:15:42,610
Please forgive us.

238
00:15:42,818 --> 00:15:45,404
You know, naturally,
