247
00:16:11,764 --> 00:16:13,432
Ballantine's.
On the rocks.

248
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:16,477
<i>Dr. Susan Harris.</i>

249
00:16:16,727 --> 00:16:20,230
Uh, she runs the comprehensive
entomological lab,

250
00:16:20,439 --> 00:16:23,734
along with Dr. Norstad,
